01:01:48.339 --> 01:01:49.672
Ibu sejati?

01:01:50.630 --> 01:01:52.422
Belanja ibu!

01:01:56.130 --> 01:01:57.964
Yuck.

01:02:00.755 --> 01:02:03.588
Aku rindu kalian, kalian tidak...

01:02:06.047 --> 01:02:07.880
