- Mungkin bisa membantu.

01:05:35.588 --> 01:05:37.880
Sering membantu hal buruk.

01:05:37.964 --> 01:05:40.964
Tidak. Melawan kehilangan.

01:05:41.047 --> 01:05:43.214
Hal-hal buruk, Miriam.

